      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "They said they'd fix the buttons (and the selfie stick) back when they added it to the game. Don't get your hopes up on the camera being worked on again until they decide to redo it from scratch or something.\nCompletely agree with the lens. it's crazy how they thought it was okay to put the lens in the middle of the screen when facing it toward you.",
